# Dependency Review Checklist

## New Dependency

### Necessity
- [ ] No existing solution
- [ ] Benefit > dependency cost

### Health
- [ ] Last commit <6 months
- [ ] Active maintainer
- [ ] No open security issues

### License
- [ ] Compatible license
- [ ] Not GPL/AGPL (unless intended)

### Quality
- [ ] TypeScript support
- [ ] Reasonable dep count

## Quarterly Audit

```bash
npm audit
npm outdated
```

- [ ] Critical/high vulns fixed
- [ ] No abandoned packages
- [ ] Major updates evaluated

## Status

| Package | Version | Audit Date | Status |
|---------|---------|------------|--------|
| | | | |
